ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AS9XC_D9NscQ7kNvwG582el&_nc_oc=AdrVCJIXxmQJBZEc_OKiy7aun5Z-j6P2BfiTSYJRoMLwlhIeAdjgiMtIvdfQmFiB4aU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2_G-4wFm2tx2k5nDuYZ9VSGZPiuZVdwC4RCGmWdmDR-g&oe=69F5FCB9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z53Z4p1z49oQ7kNvwF05WpF&_nc_oc=AdpAuOhL98RXgktdgRyti4jWPI8HnGj_UkCp2fsJdruWqqg2o_2FYlO2a_mifPl1q8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2COpc9nwBE0xEZh284jbY3r0x796HHAlx8swFQWSmQLA&oe=69F5EB0F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XEyA_khlvpcQ7kNvwGsQ_O6&_nc_oc=Adrbl3-1I0cXisbeLTC86S6DyXHWppJK7-EhL7wSYBz01zoXt5qlBLgCDhbgv_4sEow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3XFqMPmnYXQwK9YUacpT-qNqC4WYsKkMPjBodeWkzCEQ&oe=69F5F8EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa